1
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:06,040
¿Dónde has estado? Te llamé tres veces.

2
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:11,100
I know, I know.
The car broke down on the way back.

3
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:16,680
Por lo menos podrías
haberme enviado un mensaje.

4
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:22,480
<i>My phone was dead. I'm sorry, all right?</i>

5
00:01:25,380 --> 00:01:29,340
¿Quieres algo de comer?
Hay sopa en la cocina.

6
00:01:32,940 --> 00:01:37,080
No, thanks.
I just need to sit down for a minute.

7
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:40,520
¿Qué te pasó en la mano?

8
00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:46,220
It's nothing.
I cut it when I was fixing the tire.

9
00:01:48,420 --> 00:01:51,420
Déjame verla. Parece profunda.

10
00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:57,560
It doesn't hurt that much, really.

11
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:04,280
<i>Tu padre estuvo aquí esta tarde.</i>

12
00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:07,300
What did he want?

13
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:12,700
Dijo que quería hablar
contigo sobre la casa.

14
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:18,740
I told him I don't want to sell it.
Not now.

15
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:25,480
Él cree que es
lo mejor para todos nosotros.

16
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:33,400
He always thinks he knows
what is best for everyone.

17
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:37,080
Quizás esta vez tiene razón.

18
00:02:38,580 --> 00:02:41,220
<i>Are you on his side now?</i>

19
00:02:43,420 --> 00:02:47,440
- No estoy del lado de nadie.
- Solo estoy cansada.

20
00:02:50,340 --> 00:02:54,120
We can talk about
it tomorrow, if you want.

21
00:02:57,720 --> 00:03:01,020
Mañana tengo que trabajar temprano.

22
00:03:01,820 --> 00:03:04,000
Then we will talk in the evening.

23
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:09,260
¿Viste la carta del banco?

24
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:15,300
Yes.
I put it in the drawer with the others.

25
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:21,680
<i>Tenemos que pagar antes de fin de mes.</i>

26
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:28,760
I know. I will find the money somehow.

27
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:33,220
¿Cómo? Eso también dijiste la última vez.

28
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:38,260
Please, don't start again. Not tonight.

29
00:03:40,460 --> 00:03:44,540
Solo te pregunto porque
estoy preocupada por ti.

30
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:50,200
I know you are. Thank you.

31
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:57,580
- Ve a lavarte la mano.
- Yo traigo las vendas.

32
00:03:58,380 --> 00:04:00,960
<i>Where did you put them?</i>

33
00:04:02,460 --> 00:04:05,820
En el baño, en el estante de arriba.

34
00:04:08,020 --> 00:04:11,620
I found them. Can you help me with this?

35
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:17,820
No te muevas. Solo será un segundo.

36
00:04:21,420 --> 00:04:25,380
There.
Now tell me what really happened today.
